# BRB project instructions

Project instructions live in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). Read that file before
making changes; it is the single source of truth and this rule is only a pointer.

Do not duplicate guidance here — it will drift. Add it to `AGENTS.md`.

Two entry points worth knowing before you start:

- `AGENTS.md` § "Start Here and Resolve Conflicts in This Order" — the document
  priority list, and how to resolve a conflict between code and docs.
- `docs/BRB_ART_DIRECTION.md` Part 0 — the gate for any visual work. Artwork,
  room recipes, sprite geometry, and motion all pass through it.
